 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The old man sleeps in Moab and the forty years are through",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The servant of the LORD is gone, the people look to you",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Jordan's rolling wide ahead, the far bank out of sight",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Joshua son of Nun stands listening at the river's side",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Moses my servant is dead",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now get up and cross this Jordan",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As I was with Moses, so I will be with you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will not fail you or forsake you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Have I not commanded you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be strong and courageous",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be terrified or dismayed",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the LORD your God is with you wherever you go",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep the law upon your lips and think on it by day and night",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Never turning from the road to the left hand or the right",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the walls ahead are high and your knees begin to shake",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
